      "class": "caro",
      "id": "work",
      "index": 2,
      "tag": "section",
      "text": "View case study Replit Agent 3 The launch landing page for Replit's autonomous AI Agent 3. View case study Serve Robotics Brand refresh and website redesign with 3D assets and a de"
