      },
      "class": "proc bcp-parts",
      "id": "protocol-parts",
      "index": 7,
      "tag": "section",
      "text": "01 Brand Truth The one place that holds the voice, the design and the rules we build everything from. 02 Skills A job the system has been taught to do your way, ready whenever you "
    },
    {
      "box": {
        "bottom": 5434.5546875,
