      },
      "class": "sheet",
      "id": null,
      "index": 8,
      "tag": "div",
      "text": "Move your organisation up the levels of AI. PASSING ON OUR LEARNINGS This is the other half of what we do. We're a design and technology studio working with AI every day, on our ow"
    },
    {
      "box": {
        "bottom": 6503.4921875,
        "height": 1068.9375,
        "top": 5434.5546875,
        "width": 1280,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5434.5546875
      },
      "class": "caro",
      "id": "lab",
      "index": 9,
      "tag": "section",
      "text": "The tools are everywhere. The judgment isn't. For our creative team, AI has turned into a new layer of expression. The craft isn't new, but it used to need an engineer in the loop."
    },
